  "article_summary": "The wedding of Princess Märtha Louise of Norway to Durek Verrett was unconventional, with the clairvoyant princess marrying a self-described shaman from California. Despite the non-traditional nature of the event, spectators lined the streets in hopes of seeing the bride. The princess, fourth in line to the Norwegian throne, married Verrett in a church ceremony attended by royals and celebrities. Märtha Louise, who divorced in 2017, has lived a unique royal life as a clairvoyant and angel communicator. She has stepped down from official royal duties to focus on her and Verret's business ventures. Verret, known as an energy activator, counts Gwyneth Paltrow as a client and refers to her as a 'soul sister.'",
